# Everything an image build doesn't need: installs, build output, local state, secrets.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/.coverage
**/storybook-static
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.expo
**/*.log
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
logs
load/.sessions.json
docker-data
# Markdown at the root: the docs, and any notes kept next to them. No image needs them.
*.md
